        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>AHI SIG135-204-P22, Black Wedge Modern Door Levers</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMatte black modern wedge lever has a 2-1/2\" square rose, and a smooth style flat grip. This \"future modern\" door lever almost looks like a match for trim on a 1950's car! It will bring a touch of retro 1950's design to your home decor. The wedge lever is made from solid stainless steel with a super tuff matte black powder coated finish. This modern lever and rose set can be adjusted for 1-3/8 inch to 2 inch thick doors with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. The Black Wedge Modern Door Lever is easy to install and will fit all 2-1/8 inch pre-drilled doors. It is ADA compliant and is suitable for both residential and commercial applications. Available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/AHI-SIG135-204-specifications.gif?v=1704354732\" width=\"600\" height=\"142\" border=\"0\" alt=\"AHI SIG135-204 Lever Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Black Wedge Modern Door Leverset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>For residential or commercial applications</li>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors)</li>\r\n<li>Field reversible tubular latch</li>\r\n<li>Premium latch requires only 28° rotation to retract latchbolt</li>\r\n<li>Meets standards of the <a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\">Americans with Disabilities Act (ADA)</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the SIG135-204-P22 Black Wedge Modern Door Leverset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Matte Black</b></li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 5\" (127 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-1/4\" (58 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Spindle Width: 5/16\" (8 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-1/2\" (64 mm) squared</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> For use as a door pull or to match trim. Trim is on one side of door. Lever is surface mounted (mounting plate screws to the doors face).</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door levers on both sides of the door. For use with a standard 2-1/8\" bore hole pre-drilled door. </li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages\r\n privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside lever will release privacy push button and retract the door latch.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Note: Single Dummy is Handed</b>. All other functions are non-handed. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Handing Guide</b></a>\r\n</p>",
